  _landmarkId: brandenburg-kapisi
  _displayTitle: "Brandenburg Kap\u0131s\u0131"
  _shortDescription: "18. y\xFCzy\u0131l\u0131n sonunda yap\u0131lan Brandenburg
    Kap\u0131s\u0131, Berlin\u2019in en g\xFC\xE7l\xFC simgelerinden biridir. So\u011Fuk
    Sava\u015F y\u0131llar\u0131nda b\xF6l\xFCnmenin s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131nda kald\u0131;
    1989\u2019dan sonra Almanya\u2019n\u0131n yeniden birle\u015Fmesini temsil etmeye
    ba\u015Flad\u0131. Kap\u0131n\u0131n tepesindeki d\xF6rt atl\u0131 Quadriga heykeli,
    zafer tanr\u0131\xE7as\u0131n\u0131 \u015Fehre do\u011Fru ilerlerken g\xF6sterir."
  _sector: Berlin / ALMANYA
